{"id": "EUVD-2026-82034", "enisaUuid": "6f10d7d3-3a70-3734-ad58-9fae1f1ae658", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nwifi: mt76: mt7915: clear wcid mask under mutex after RCU pointer clear\n\nmt7915_remove_interface() cleared the wcid mask bit with no lock held and\nbefore clearing the RCU wcid pointer. The mask is a non-atomic RMW shared\nwith the allocators, which all run under dev->mt76.mutex; on DBDC the two\nwiphys share one mt76_dev, so this raced add_interface/sta_add on the\nother band and could leak or double-hand-out a wcid. Clearing the bit\nbefore the RCU pointer also let a concurrent allocation reuse the index\nand publish its wcid, which the subsequent NULL assignment then wiped.\nMove the clear into the existing mutex section, after the RCU pointer is\ncleared.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:09:13", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:51:22", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5dce25f1d609ba991a9c22c27be586c92f03ed77", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b4a41a47a67c788e6b0625fa517ec8872e99bb6c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a97b2b942d2f8f12fbd6a7caafc735d1ad115e6b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6486e11a6e2f679597af2d5bb48c3b07a2b2a7ba"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-90373", "GHSA-4c4x-fg8c-5526"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2da745a3-d93c-31f3-8b9c-ed3c2056c97d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.110"}, {"id": "34842d8e-9fd9-3ddc-9680-3e5da1816333", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f3049b88b2b32326df97461813ae73e8bbc296fc <a97b2b942d2f8f12fbd6a7caafc735d1ad115e6b"}, {"id": "4400c03b-aa20-38d2-ab38-503238a1499d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.6.160 <6.7"}, {"id": "4cf74db0-b105-3c6e-a704-0990e6315b87", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f3049b88b2b32326df97461813ae73e8bbc296fc <6486e11a6e2f679597af2d5bb48c3b07a2b2a7ba"}, {"id": "5b83a203-1c21-3c9e-9186-40bd3480f4ac", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a582b1d54313dcdc96e7d8e1f49495dd71ddaf3e"}, {"id": "69095a1f-8097-393e-9ccd-3587d65027b2", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.52"}, {"id": "6fbd6316-75c2-3905-921d-c6bd24042ab3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "895c917c-956c-3e65-ad11-ca289063ee90", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.6"}, {"id": "9c31acf0-af5f-3d5d-ada0-bb253170d4dc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12"}, {"id": "b71b01bc-63c9-36d6-a504-3ab26dbabe72", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "bf172679-7320-3d40-8543-aaf34a24cb27", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f3049b88b2b32326df97461813ae73e8bbc296fc <5dce25f1d609ba991a9c22c27be586c92f03ed77"}, {"id": "e143226a-e559-37b4-a56e-61c0fdf2b898", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f3049b88b2b32326df97461813ae73e8bbc296fc <b4a41a47a67c788e6b0625fa517ec8872e99bb6c"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "230f53b2-5fc5-3b9c-8983-f75b76891ee2", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}